* Unit windows around 1-separated points of [ -u T , T ] are disjoint subintervals of ( -u ( T + 1 ) , T + 1 ): the window integrals of a nonnegative continuous function sum to at most its integral there (LargeValues per_char_sobolev, hsum_r).

